Kathy was born in [[County Kerry, Ireland]] where she grew up in the [[Lambert house]] with her younger brother, Lok. {{Source|Home Turf}}

When the Huntik team arrived at the Lambert house for their vacation, Kathy was out at her summer class. On the way home, she helped [[Scarlet Byrne]] who was being followed by a group of [[Klaus]]' [[Suits]]. She hugged Lok before going upstair to telephone her friend. {{source|Home Turf}}

When the Huntik team sought refuge at the Lambert house following their defeat at the hands of [[Rassimov]], Kathy walked in and witnessed the team using their powers. Dante then took Kathy aside and used [[Simplemind]] to make her forget what she saw. Later, Kathy mistakenly assumed that [[Sophie Casterwill]] was jealous of Scarlet's banter with [[Dante Vale]]. Sophie then tried to explain that [[Zhalia]] would have been the jealous one. {{source|Back Home}}
